# ── COMMITTED ON PURPOSE ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# models/     -> train.py cannot run on Streamlit Cloud, so the deployed
#                app needs the artifacts in the repo.
# data/cache/ -> lets the dashboard run at zero API credits, and lets
#                anyone re-train without buying the data again.
# Both are real Sectors data. The app always shows the snapshot date.

# Intermediate research table: large and rebuildable, so excluded.
data/dataset.parquet

